{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge the colored blocks to form larger colored combinations as the speed gradually increases, challenging you to maximize your score and set a new high score. Stay strategic and quick to adapt as the pace intensifies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Match four vibrant blocks in cozy clusters. Easy to learn, satisfying to master, with a quiet challenge that grows as you play</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every speed increase, the blocks accelerate, forge vast unions of color before time outmaneuvers your strategy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start by blending small blocks, but as momentum surges, craft sprawling mergers to outpace the rising challenge and reign supreme</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple core mechanic with a colorful/soft palette which has a relaxing tone with underlying challenge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play for 5 minutes In the Demo</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3968310?t=1755869305","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3968310?t=1755869305","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968310/062ea53d48c3b57aed091f5177f3dc0f64448543/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755869305","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968310/062ea53d48c3b57aed091f5177f3dc0f64448543/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755869305","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_descriptio